\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"title: \\\\\\\"Stop Chasing Every Lead. Here's How to Qualify Fast and Close More.\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"category: \\\\\\\"Founder Mistakes\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"date: \\\\\\\"February 10, 2026\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"readTime: \\\\\\\"6 min read\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"author: \\\\\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h1\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Stop Chasing Every Lead. Here's How to Qualify Fast and Close More.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"There's a version of \\\\\\\"hustle culture\\\\\\\" that's actually destroying your close rate. It looks like this: you treat every single lead the same, you follow up with all of them with equal energy, you take every intro call regardless of fit, and you spend your best hours on people who will never buy.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The data on this is brutal. In most early-stage B2B startups, 60–70% of leads that enter the pipeline will never convert — not because of price, not because of competition, but because they were never a real lead to begin with. They were curious, or they were tyre-kickers, or they were students researching the space, or they were a completely different company size than your actual ICP.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"If you're treating all of them with the same urgency, you're spending 40% of your time on nothing.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"14\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Pattern: How Founders Fall Into This Trap\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"It starts with scarcity. In the early months, every lead feels precious because leads are hard to come by. You don't want to miss any. So you take every call, reply to every email, follow up with every inquiry.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"17\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"18\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"But leads aren't equally valuable. A startup founder with 3 employees asking about enterprise pricing is not a lead — they're a curious bystander. A marketing head at a 200-person company who just asked for a demo link is a lead. Treating both the same is a time management catastrophe.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"19\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"20\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The second trap: optimism bias. \\\\\\\"They seemed interested\\\\\\\" is not the same as \\\\\\\"they're likely to buy.\\\\\\\" Founders are naturally optimistic — it's a feature, not a bug. But it means you'll spend 3 follow-up calls on someone who's going to say no because you couldn't bring yourself to disqualify them after the first one.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"21\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"22\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A 5-Minute Qualification Framework\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"23\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"24\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You can know within 5 minutes whether a lead is worth pursuing. The BANT framework (Budget, Authority, Need, Timeline) is old but still useful, adapted for the Indian early-stage context:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"25\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"26\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Budget**: \\\\\\\"Are you currently budgeting for this type of solution, or would this be a new category spend?\\\\\\\" If they've never spent on anything in your category, the sales cycle will be 4x longer. Not necessarily disqualifying — but know what you're dealing with.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"27\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"28\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Authority**: \\\\\\\"Who else would be involved in the decision to move forward?\\\\\\\" If you're talking to a junior person who needs 4 sign-offs, that's a different process than talking to a founder or a department head with P\\u0026L ownership.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"29\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"30\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Need**: \\\\\\\"What's the current cost of not solving this problem?\\\\\\\" If they struggle to answer, the pain isn't acute enough. Real buyers know exactly what the problem is costing them.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"31\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"32\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Timeline**: \\\\\\\"If this solution ticked every box, how quickly could you move?\\\\\\\" More than 6 months = not a near-term lead. Worth nurturing, but not worth active selling time today.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"33\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"34\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You don't need to ask these as formal questions. They come out naturally in the first 5 minutes of any conversation if you're listening for them.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"35\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"36\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Disqualification Discipline\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"37\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"38\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The skill that separates efficient founders from overwhelmed ones is the ability to disqualify fast and without guilt.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"39\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"40\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Disqualifying a lead doesn't mean they're gone forever. It means they go into a nurture sequence — automated follow-ups every 4–6 weeks with useful content — until their situation changes. Pulsar can handle this automatically. You focus on the leads that are ready now.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"41\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"42\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Signs to disqualify immediately:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"43\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"They can't describe the problem they're trying to solve\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"44\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"They're not the decision-maker and can't get you access to one\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"45\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Their budget expectation is 5x below your price (not a negotiation gap — an expectation gap)\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"46\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"They want the full enterprise build for a startup price\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"47\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"They've been \\\\\\\"almost ready to move forward\\\\\\\" for more than 6 weeks\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"48\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"49\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"That last one is the hardest. Sunk cost fallacy hits hard when you've already spent 4 calls on someone. But the 5th call rarely converts what the first 4 didn't.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"50\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"51\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Build a Two-Track System\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"52\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"53\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The practical solution is to run two tracks simultaneously:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"54\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"55\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Track 1 — Active pipeline**: Qualified leads you're actively selling. These get your full attention, personalised follow-up, and quick response times. Aim for no more than 15–20 at any given time.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"56\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"57\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Track 2 — Nurture pipeline**: Everyone else — too early, too small, unclear timeline, needs more education. These go into an automated sequence. Pulsar sends them useful content, periodic check-ins, and re-qualification prompts every few weeks. When something changes on their end, they raise their hand. Then you move them to Track 1.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"58\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"59\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"This system means you're never ignoring a lead permanently — you're just allocating your attention proportionally to their actual readiness to buy.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"60\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"61\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Result\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"62\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"63\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Founders who implement this framework consistently report the same outcome: they take fewer calls, but they close more. Response times on real leads improve because your inbox isn't cluttered with noise. Your pipeline velocity increases because you're not stuck behind a backlog of leads who aren't going anywhere.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"64\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"65\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"More importantly, you stop ending weeks feeling like you were incredibly busy but somehow didn't move the needle. Because you were chasing the right things.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"66\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"67\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"68\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Key Takeaways\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"69\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"70\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"60–70% of early-stage B2B leads will never convert — treating all of them equally wastes your best hours\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"71\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"BANT (Budget, Authority, Need, Timeline) gives you a qualification answer in 5 minutes\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"72\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Disqualified leads aren't dead — move them to automated nurture, not the bin\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"73\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A two-track system (active + nurture) lets you serve all leads without spreading yourself thin\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"74\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"75\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"76\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 italic my-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Pulsar qualifies your inbound leads automatically and routes the right ones to you. [Start your free 7-day trial →](/)\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"77\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Le\\\",null,{}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-8 bg-brand-gold-pale dark:bg-brand-gold/8 border border-brand-gold/20 dark:border-brand-gold/15 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Ready to automate your GTM?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"100 free credits. No card required. Setup in 24 hours.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/pricing\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-gold text-brand-black font-body font-semibold rounded-full px-6 py-3 hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all hover:scale-[1.03]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Start your free trial →\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-8 text-center\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/blog\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/30 hover:text-brand-gold dark:hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"← Back to all posts\\\"}]}]]}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"b:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing \\u0026 Outreach Agents for Founders\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated. Gravity posts, Pulsar calls. Built for Indian founders and SMBs. Start free — 100 credits, no card.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"keywords\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"AI marketing automation India,AI outreach agent,GTM for startups,WhatsApp sales automation,AI sales agent SMB India\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"robots\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"index, follow\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://nebulaa.ai\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:title\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Nebulaa.ai — Your GTM Team Just Showed Up\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Gravity posts. Pulsar calls. You close.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:url\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"https://nebulaa.ai\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:site_name\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Nebulaa.ai\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:locale\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"en_IN\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:type\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"website\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:card\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"summary_large_image\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"14\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:site\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"@nebulaaai\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:title\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing \\u0026 Outreach for Founders\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"17\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/favicon.ico\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image/x-icon\\\",\\\"sizes\\\":\\\"16x16\\\"}]]\\n3:null\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"3:I[4707,[],\"\"]\n5:I[6423,[],\"\"]\n7:I[2144,[\"972\",\"static/chunks/972-8c0ee6fabcd1342f.js\",\"309\",\"static/chunks/309-526a3bc2ba734d25.js\",\"878\",\"static/chunks/878-ed980f2cac33ad8c.js\",\"739\",\"static/chunks/739-3ece649a7e02ff75.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-5a72189eaa6243d0.js\"],\"default\"]\n8:I[6194,[\"972\",\"static/chunks/972-8c0ee6fabcd1342f.js\",\"309\",\"static/chunks/309-526a3bc2ba734d25.js\",\"878\",\"static/chunks/878-ed980f2cac33ad8c.js\",\"739\",\"static/chunks/739-3ece649a7e02ff75.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-5a72189eaa6243d0.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:[\"slug\",\"founder-mistake-chasing-every-lead\",\"d\"]\n6:T5c5,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"legalName\":\"Noburo Business Services LLP\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\",\"email\":\"hello@nebulaa.ai\",\"description\":\"Nebulaa is a Chennai-based AI marketing company. It builds two agents — Gravity for marketing and Pulsar for outreach — and runs managed marketing engagements for brands across South India.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2025\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chennai\",\"addressRegion\":\"Tamil Nadu\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"},\"makesOffer\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"price\":\"10000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"description\":\"Reads a website and builds a marketing strategy from it, plans the month, drafts posts, carousels and reels, tracks competitors, runs campaigns and creator collaborations, and handles the social inbox.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"price\":\"15000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"description\":\"Answers enquiries on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"price\":\"20000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"description\":\"Gravity and Pulsar on one account, sharing the same brand memory.\"}}]}0:[\"vqg3I8PMiwBbcgwQxIKIJ\",[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"blog\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"founder-mistake-chasing-every-lead\",\"d\"],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__?{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"founder-mistake-chasing-every-lead\\\"}\",{}]}]}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],[\"\",{\"children\":[\"blog\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"founder-mistake-chasing-every-lead\",\"d\"],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{},[[\"$L1\",\"$L2\",null],null],null]},[null,[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"segmentPath\":[\"children\",\"blog\",\"children\",\"$4\",\"children\"],\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"notFoundStyles\":\"$undefined\"}]],null]},[null,[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"segmentPath\":[\"children\",\"blog\",\"children\"],\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"notFoundStyles\":\"$undefined\"}]],null]},[[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/91d486bf57bf1762.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"head\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"preconnect\",\"href\":\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"preconnect\",\"href\":\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\",\"crossOrigin\":\"anonymous\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"href\":\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\",\"rel\":\"stylesheet\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$6\"}}]]}],[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-ground text-ink font-body antialiased\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"segmentPath\":[\"children\"],\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"title\",null,{\"children\":\"404: This page could not be found.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"system-ui,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,\\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\",\\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\"\",\"height\":\"100vh\",\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"flexDirection\":\"column\",\"alignItems\":\"center\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"style\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"body{color:#000;background:#fff;margin:0}.next-error-h1{border-right:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.3)}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#fff;background:#000}.next-error-h1{border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3)}}\"}}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"next-error-h1\",\"style\":{\"display\":\"inline-block\",\"margin\":\"0 20px 0 0\",\"padding\":\"0 23px 0 0\",\"fontSize\":24,\"fontWeight\":500,\"verticalAlign\":\"top\",\"lineHeight\":\"49px\"},\"children\":\"404\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"display\":\"inline-block\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":14,\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"49px\",\"margin\":0},\"children\":\"This page could not be found.\"}]}]]}]}]],\"notFoundStyles\":[]}]}]}]}]]}]],null],null],[\"$L9\",null]]]]\na:I[1644,[\"308\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-4ebbaccc1d438f3e.js\"],\"default\"]\n2:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white dark:bg-[#0A0A0A] min-h-screen pt-24 pb-20 transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-1.5 w-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500/20 to-cyan-400/5 rounded-full mb-6\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4\",\"children\":\"Founder Mistakes\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-text dark:text-white leading-tight mb-4 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Stop Chasing Every Lead. Here's How to Qualify Fast and Close More.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/40\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Nebulaa Team\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"February 10, 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"6 min read\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose-nebulaa\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"title: \\\"Stop Chasing Every Lead. Here's How to Qualify Fast and Close More.\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"category: \\\"Founder Mistakes\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"date: \\\"February 10, 2026\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"readTime: \\\"6 min read\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"author: \\\"Nebulaa Team\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Stop Chasing Every Lead. Here's How to Qualify Fast and Close More.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"There's a version of \\\"hustle culture\\\" that's actually destroying your close rate. It looks like this: you treat every single lead the same, you follow up with all of them with equal energy, you take every intro call regardless of fit, and you spend your best hours on people who will never buy.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"The data on this is brutal. In most early-stage B2B startups, 60–70% of leads that enter the pipeline will never convert — not because of price, not because of competition, but because they were never a real lead to begin with. They were curious, or they were tyre-kickers, or they were students researching the space, or they were a completely different company size than your actual ICP.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"If you're treating all of them with the same urgency, you're spending 40% of your time on nothing.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"The Pattern: How Founders Fall Into This Trap\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"It starts with scarcity. In the early months, every lead feels precious because leads are hard to come by. You don't want to miss any. So you take every call, reply to every email, follow up with every inquiry.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"17\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"But leads aren't equally valuable. A startup founder with 3 employees asking about enterprise pricing is not a lead — they're a curious bystander. A marketing head at a 200-person company who just asked for a demo link is a lead. Treating both the same is a time management catastrophe.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"19\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"The second trap: optimism bias. \\\"They seemed interested\\\" is not the same as \\\"they're likely to buy.\\\" Founders are naturally optimistic — it's a feature, not a bug. But it means you'll spend 3 follow-up calls on someone who's going to say no because you couldn't bring yourself to disqualify them after the first one.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"A 5-Minute Qualification Framework\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"You can know within 5 minutes whether a lead is worth pursuing. The BANT framework (Budget, Authority, Need, Timeline) is old but still useful, adapted for the Indian early-stage context:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Budget**: \\\"Are you currently budgeting for this type of solution, or would this be a new category spend?\\\" If they've never spent on anything in your category, the sales cycle will be 4x longer. Not necessarily disqualifying — but know what you're dealing with.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"27\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Authority**: \\\"Who else would be involved in the decision to move forward?\\\" If you're talking to a junior person who needs 4 sign-offs, that's a different process than talking to a founder or a department head with P&L ownership.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"29\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Need**: \\\"What's the current cost of not solving this problem?\\\" If they struggle to answer, the pain isn't acute enough. Real buyers know exactly what the problem is costing them.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"31\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Timeline**: \\\"If this solution ticked every box, how quickly could you move?\\\" More than 6 months = not a near-term lead. Worth nurturing, but not worth active selling time today.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"33\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"You don't need to ask these as formal questions. They come out naturally in the first 5 minutes of any conversation if you're listening for them.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"35\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"The Disqualification Discipline\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"37\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"The skill that separates efficient founders from overwhelmed ones is the ability to disqualify fast and without guilt.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"39\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Disqualifying a lead doesn't mean they're gone forever. It means they go into a nurture sequence — automated follow-ups every 4–6 weeks with useful content — until their situation changes. Pulsar can handle this automatically. You focus on the leads that are ready now.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"41\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Signs to disqualify immediately:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"They can't describe the problem they're trying to solve\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"They're not the decision-maker and can't get you access to one\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Their budget expectation is 5x below your price (not a negotiation gap — an expectation gap)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"They want the full enterprise build for a startup price\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"They've been \\\"almost ready to move forward\\\" for more than 6 weeks\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"48\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"That last one is the hardest. Sunk cost fallacy hits hard when you've already spent 4 calls on someone. But the 5th call rarely converts what the first 4 didn't.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"50\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"51\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Build a Two-Track System\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"52\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"The practical solution is to run two tracks simultaneously:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"54\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Track 1 — Active pipeline**: Qualified leads you're actively selling. These get your full attention, personalised follow-up, and quick response times. Aim for no more than 15–20 at any given time.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"56\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Track 2 — Nurture pipeline**: Everyone else — too early, too small, unclear timeline, needs more education. These go into an automated sequence. Pulsar sends them useful content, periodic check-ins, and re-qualification prompts every few weeks. When something changes on their end, they raise their hand. Then you move them to Track 1.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"58\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"This system means you're never ignoring a lead permanently — you're just allocating your attention proportionally to their actual readiness to buy.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"60\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"The Result\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Founders who implement this framework consistently report the same outcome: they take fewer calls, but they close more. Response times on real leads improve because your inbox isn't cluttered with noise. Your pipeline velocity increases because you're not stuck behind a backlog of leads who aren't going anywhere.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"64\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"65\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"More importantly, you stop ending weeks feeling like you were incredibly busy but somehow didn't move the needle. Because you were chasing the right things.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"66\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"67\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"68\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Key Takeaways\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"69\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"70\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"60–70% of early-stage B2B leads will never convert — treating all of them equally wastes your best hours\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"BANT (Budget, Authority, Need, Timeline) gives you a qualification answer in 5 minutes\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Disqualified leads aren't dead — move them to automated nurture, not the bin\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"A two-track system (active + nurture) lets you serve all leads without spreading yourself thin\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"76\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 italic my-2\",\"children\":\"Pulsar qualifies your inbound leads automatically and routes the right ones to you. [Start your free 7-day trial →](/)\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"77\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 bg-brand-gold-pale dark:bg-brand-gold/8 border border-brand-gold/20 dark:border-brand-gold/15 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\",\"children\":